Dialogue: 0,2:37:41.89,2:37:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你会找到 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You will find. ∮
Dialogue: 0,2:37:44.09,2:37:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们不再需要什么 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We need nothing more. ∮
